What is the base image for this image? [1-2, 0 for none]: 2

  1) [x] build  builds, scans, signs and publishes every image
  2) [x] build-disk  builds a disk image with bootc-image-builder
  3) [x] base-sig-probe  measures what each base signs and ships, and fixes it
  4) [x] cleanup-registry  prunes old versions of the images off the registry
  5) [ ] (unavailable) kernel-freshness  needs a component taking a KERNEL arg
  6) [x] smoke-test  installs the image to a disk and boots it under qemu
  7) [x] update-components  refreshes tracked components and opens a pull request
